import site/games/farm/preparation.dl
import site/games/farm/document.dl

set document to the initial website farm document
set world to document's world
set role to the item at 0 in (document's roles)
set worker to the item at 0 in (world's workers)
set plan to the website farm plan from (the string form of "LOOP|-1\nDO|1|3|-1|-2|\nEND") dropping 0 source lines
set source to the string form of "loop forever:\n    turn right"
apply website farm plan plan from source to role for worker in world
require condition ((worker's role = role's id) and ((role's prepared) and (role's applied = source))) reporting "Applying a Farm plan lost its source or assignment."
advance the website farm world world using roles (document's roles) with workers running true
set worker's paused to true
set worker's held to true
set role's needs rebuilding to true
set role's source to source + "\n# A draft to keep"
set marked to a copy of website farm plan plan
set instruction to the item at 1 in (marked's code)
set instruction's source's known to true
set instruction's source's start line to 1
set instruction's source's start column to 4
set instruction's source's end line to 1
set instruction's source's end column to 14
replace item at index 1 in (marked's code) with instruction
set error to rebuild website farm role role using plan marked in world
require condition (error is empty) reporting "Source mapping rejected unchanged Farm control flow."
require condition ((worker's routine's position = 2) and ((worker's direction = 1) and ((worker's paused) and (worker's held)))) reporting "Rebuilding reset a worker or its controls."
require condition ((role's needs rebuilding = false) and (role's source ends with "# A draft to keep")) reporting "Rebuilding lost a draft or kept its pending flag."
require condition ((worker's routine's traced = false) and (worker's routine's source's known = false)) reporting "Rebuilding retained source ranges from the previous language version."
set changed to a copy of website farm plan marked
set opening to the item at 0 in (changed's code)
set opening's count to 2
replace item at index 0 in (changed's code) with opening
set role's needs rebuilding to true
set error to rebuild website farm role role using plan changed in world
require condition (error is not empty) reporting "Rebuilding accepted a changed loop count."
require condition ((role's needs rebuilding) and ((the item at 0 in (role's program's code))'s count = -1)) reporting "A failed rebuild replaced the live plan."
set worker's paused to false
set worker's held to false
advance the website farm world world using roles (document's roles) with workers running true
require condition (worker's direction = 2) reporting "A rebuilt worker failed to resume its active loop."
# Applying an edited role resets every assigned worker, while other roles keep
# their own execution state. Paused/held controls are independent of assignment.
set second to a website farm worker named "Grace" identified by "worker-2" at 5 12
append second to world's workers
assign website farm role role to second
advance the website farm world world using roles (document's roles) with workers running true
set worker's paused to true
apply website farm plan changed from (the string form of "loop 2 times:\n    turn right") to role for second in world
require condition ((worker's routine's position = 0) and (second's routine's position = 0)) reporting "Applying a shared role did not reset all assigned workers."
require condition (worker's paused) reporting "Applying a role changed a worker's pause control."
free website farm plan the address of plan
free website farm plan the address of marked
free website farm plan the address of changed
free website farm document document
print line "Farm applies shared roles and rebuilds source mappings without restarting saved worker state."
